1110 0 obj
<<
/Title (By this stage, it became clear that the conflict was no longer sustainable in its current form. The combination of internal divisions, external pressure, and continuous violence placed significant strain on both factions. The escalation highlighted the limitations of the existing system and set the stage for a turning point in the structure of organized crime, as the need for a more stable and coordinated approach became increasingly evident.)
/Dest [33 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1112 0 R
/Next 1108 0 R
>>
endobj
