1122 0 obj
<<
/Title (The Castellammarese War was not simply a conflict between two rival bosses, but a struggle that changed the balance of power inside organized crime entirely. Old traditions began clashing with a younger generation focused more on profit, expansion, and long-term control. Some mafiosi relied on loyalty and fear, others relied on strategy, diplomacy, business, and connections. Throughout the war, crews disappeared, betrayals became common, and neutrality slowly became impossible.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1120 0 R
/Next 1124 0 R
>>
endobj
